<title>FINLAND: Nokia strong, talk of new &quot;buy&quot; report.</title>
<headline>Nokia strong, talk of new &quot;buy&quot; report.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy rose sharply on Monday to outpace the performance of its ADR in New York last Friday.</p>
<p>At 1415/1115 GMT, Nokia traded at 378.00 markka, up 13.00 markka over three percent after touching a life-high 380.00.</p>
<p>One broker said a U.S. house had announced a buy recommendation on Nokia and this was fuelling the share.</p>
<p>&quot;(A) 400 markka (price) for Nokia is not impossible in the near term,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Others talked of short-covering after a dip last week.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
